{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_018AttjdHF8xkHTTFnyN3Fn3", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_McEntire_albums_discography\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/So_Good_Together\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_discography\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatest_Hits_Volume_III:_I'm_a_Survivor\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RIAA_certified\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_Number_1's\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_McEntire's_Greatest_Hits\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Best_of_Reba_McEntire\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_(album)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/What_If_It's_You\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:42:51.836Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Reba McEntire So Good Together 1999 album certified Gold RIAA", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_018fJWWxX9Q2UCXMnckaDuzr", "content": [{"title": "Reba McEntire albums discography", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_McEntire_albums_discography"}, {"title": "So Good Together", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/So_Good_Together"}, {"title": "Reba McEntire", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_discography"}, {"title": "Greatest Hits Volume III: I'm a Survivor", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatest_Hits_Volume_III:_I'm_a_Survivor"}, {"title": "RIAA certification", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RIAA_certified"}, {"title": "Reba Number 1's", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_Number_1's"}, {"title": "Reba McEntire's Greatest Hits", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_McEntire's_Greatest_Hits"}, {"title": "The Best of Reba McEntire", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Best_of_Reba_McEntire"}, {"title": "Reba (album)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reba_(album)"}, {"title": "What If It's You", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/What_If_It's_You"}]}, "The search doesn't support the Gold premise. Both sources that address the album's RIAA status list it as Platinum, not Gold.\n\n- **Wikipedia's discography page** lists RIAA: Platinum for the album, which was released November 23, 1999 on MCA Nashville.\n- **The album's own Wikipedia page** reports that the release received platinum certification from the RIAA. Its certifications table also shows Platinum, with no sales figure given.\n\nOther context from the results: the album sold 49,000 copies in its first week, according to that page. Its lead single, \"What Do You Say,\" peaked at number 3 on the country singles chart. The discography page also notes that 27 of her albums have received a certification of at least Gold from the Recording Industry Association of America, so Gold is a common level for her catalog, but it isn't the award this album received."], "durationSeconds": 6.137568334, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_018AttjdHF8xkHTTFnyN3Fn3", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
